    shortDescription:
      "Manual punch cards and proxy attendance cost you accuracy and trust. We built an enterprise-grade, AI-powered attendance platform that records only explicit LOGIN/LOGOUT events, stores zero raw face images, and separates live presence from historical reporting—so payroll and analytics are correct, auditable, and privacy-first.",
    imageUrl: "/images/portfolio/attendence.png",
    tags: ["Enterprise", "AI", "Face Recognition", "Attendance", "Workforce", "Privacy-First", "FastAPI", "React", "Analytics"],
    longDescription:
      "NeoMinds Attendance is an enterprise-grade, AI-powered attendance management system built for organizations that demand accuracy, privacy, and real-time operational visibility. With a privacy-first architecture, the platform clearly separates live presence from historical reporting—eliminating manual attendance errors while delivering reliable workforce insights. It is engineered for high-trust environments: enterprises, institutions, and technology hubs where correctness and auditability are paramount.\n\nAbout the product\n\nThe platform combines AI-based face recognition, event-driven attendance logic, and a calm, enterprise-focused UI. Core design principles prioritize data integrity and user privacy, making it a robust choice for advanced workforce management. Attendance is recorded exclusively through explicit events (LOGIN / LOGOUT). No raw face images are stored; only encrypted biometric embeddings. Live status is derived strictly from the latest event (ACTIVE/INACTIVE), preventing false \"Absent\" states. Daily attendance is computed from events—PRESENT (≥ 7 hours), HALF_DAY (≥ 3 hours), ABSENT (< 3 hours)—with no synthetic records and accurate handling of missing logouts during report generation.\n\nWhat problem it solves\n\nTraditional systems suffer from manual intervention, proxy attendance, inaccurate daily summaries (impacting payroll and performance analysis), and privacy risks from image storage. Dashboards that mix live and historical data often obscure operational insights. NeoMinds Attendance addresses this by: event-only recording (LOGIN/LOGOUT), no raw image storage (encrypted embeddings only), strict separation of live status vs. daily attendance, precisely computed reports (no estimations), and stability even with incomplete data.\n\nCore capabilities\n\n• Privacy-first AI attendance — Camera-based face recognition with encrypted 512-D biometric embeddings; no raw images stored; event-based recognition (no continuous tracking).\n• Live status monitoring — Real-time workforce status (ACTIVE/INACTIVE) from the latest attendance event only.\n• Computed attendance history — Daily attendance from LOGIN/LOGOUT events only; PRESENT, HALF_DAY, ABSENT; missing logout handled at computation time; no daily attendance table stored.\n• Employee analytics — Per-employee insights: average login/logout times, working hour trends, punctuality metrics; read-only and audit-safe.\n• Admin and kiosk separation — JWT-protected Admin Panel (dashboard, employee directory, attendance history and exports, analytics); dedicated Kiosk Panel for staff check-in/out with device-based access, auto-start camera, ~800ms face scan, minimal UI (Name + Login/Logout), walk-away reset.\n\nSystem architecture\n\nTwo-panel design: Admin Panel (JWT auth, live status dashboard, employee management, attendance history and exports, analytics); Kiosk/Staff Panel (device access, camera auto-start, fast recognition, minimal UI, walk-away reset). Attendance logic: Live status = latest event only (LOGIN → ACTIVE, LOGOUT → INACTIVE), no time calculations. Daily attendance = computed from events; no stored daily table; false states and audit inconsistency eliminated.\n\nTechnology stack\n\n• Backend: Python, FastAPI (high-performance async APIs, event-driven processing), JWT authentication.\n• AI and face recognition: InsightFace SCRFD and ArcFace (detection and 512-D embeddings), Cosine Similarity and Fernet (recognition and encrypted embeddings). No raw images, redundant tables, or synthetic data stored.\n• Frontend: React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS (modern, responsive UI); shadcn/ui and Aura-inspired UI (consistent, professional experience).\n• Database: Employee data, encrypted face embeddings, attendance events, admin users, devices—no raw images.\n\nSecurity and compliance\n\nNo biometric images stored—only encrypted embeddings. Full audit trail via event logs. JWT-secured admin access. Device-aware kiosk architecture at check-in/out points. No background surveillance or tracking. Privacy-by-design from inception.\n\nDesigned for enterprise\n\nTailored for technology companies, institutions and campuses, enterprise offices, and secure work environments. The system prioritizes correctness over assumptions, clarity over complexity, and stability over flashiness—ideal for organizations that value precision, transparency, and reliability in attendance and workforce intelligence.",
